.TH SENSORPULSE-SERVICE 1 "November 2026" "SensorPulse @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sensorpulse-service \- user service that reads the sensors for SensorPulse
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sensorpulse-service
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads the hardware sensors without root, evaluates the alarms, shows notifications, plays
the alarm sounds and publishes the data on the session D-Bus as
\fBio.github.mintmotion.SensorPulse\fR. It is started automatically by D-Bus activation or by
the systemd user unit \fBsensorpulse.service\fR; it is not meant to be run by hand.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sensorpulse (1)
